contentText:
Megan Thee Stallion has been flexing her acting chops in The Fall & Rise of Reggie Dinkins , and the Houston Hottie makes another appearance in Monday&#8217;s (March 30) episode of the NBC series.

Megan, who plays a divorced mailcarrier named Denise, posted a teaser from Monday night&#8217;s episode, which finds her getting flirty with Daniel Radcliffe. The Harry Potter star portrays an acclaimed filmmaker named Arthur Tobin, and he definitely seems into Denise.

